{'symbol': 'LVS', 'date': '2022-12-17 01:33:00', 'title': 'SANDS CHINA PRESENTS ITS VISION AND INVESTMENT FOR THE NEXT DECADE IN MACAO COMPANY BELIEVES IN LONG-TERM GROWTH OF MACAO', 'text': "MACAO , DEC. 17, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- WITH THE SIGNING OF A NEW 10-YEAR GAMING CONCESSION IN MACAO COMPLETE, SANDS CHINA LTD., A MAJORITY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF LAS VEGAS SANDS CORP. (NYSE: LVS) TODAY OUTLINED ITS VISION FOR THE COMPANY'S NEXT TEN YEARS IN MACAO."}